WEBVTT

00:08.880 --> 00:09.880
<b>What the hell...?</b>

00:10.460 --> 00:15.040
<b>Ai's god must've done this. I knew it would.</b>

00:16.080 --> 00:17.830
<b>It's this powerful?!</b>

00:19.500 --> 00:22.960
<b>How can we even contend with something like this?!</b>

00:24.670 --> 00:25.580
<b>I can use this.</b>

00:26.880 --> 00:29.380
<b>We'll just have to get even with it.</b>

00:29.750 --> 00:32.630
<b>Is that so? And how are you going to do that?</b>

00:42.290 --> 00:45.670
<b>You think you would even be a challenge?</b>

00:45.960 --> 00:47.790
<b>I know I would beat you.</b>

00:48.920 --> 00:52.750
<b>You must be at least five hundred years old.</b>

00:53.080 --> 00:57.460
<b>And you're going to "marry" her at twenty?</b>

00:57.710 --> 01:01.130
<b>I'm not going to let some god
and his problematic age gap beat me.</b>

01:04.130 --> 01:08.460
<b>I prefer my women with larger busts,
but you've forced my hand.</b>

01:09.540 --> 01:10.540
<b>Come, then.</b>

01:10.920 --> 01:12.290
<b>I'll be waiting.</b>

01:12.790 --> 01:17.000
<b>And when the time comes, I will take you instead.</b>

01:17.420 --> 01:19.790
<b>Entertain me, why don't you?!</b>

01:21.000 --> 01:25.210
<b>I-I'm not gonna let you lay a finger on my students!</b>

01:26.830 --> 01:27.880
<b>Keitaro...</b>

01:33.830 --> 01:39.170
<b>They're not shaking in fear.
They're shaking from how badly they want to kill it.</b>

01:41.080 --> 01:42.380
<b>We'll protect Ai.</b>

01:43.290 --> 01:44.920
<b>We'll protect everyone.</b>

01:45.920 --> 01:51.710
<b>We will prepare a throne suitable for your divinity,
from which you will serve us all.</b>

01:55.500 --> 02:03.420
<b>While we walk the world of the living,
the dead drift through the spirit world.</b>

02:04.540 --> 02:11.080
<b>These two worlds sometimes intersect,
allowing evil spirits to do harm to the living.</b>

02:11.830 --> 02:19.460
<b>This young girl is gathering dark power
to slay the spirit who took her loved one.</b>

02:20.080 --> 02:25.330
<b>The grudges of the dead,
used to pursue a grudge far greater...</b>

04:01.920 --> 04:03.540
<b>Come, then.</b>

04:07.920 --> 04:09.000
<b>It's gone.</b>

04:09.920 --> 04:14.290
<b>Make your preparations.
Come at me with everything you've got.</b>

04:15.330 --> 04:17.920
<b>I will tear you apart,</b>

04:18.250 --> 04:22.000
<b>ravage your body and soul.</b>

04:23.920 --> 04:25.250
<b>Fight all you want.</b>

04:25.790 --> 04:29.750
<b>Ai's fate will remain unchanged.</b>

04:35.880 --> 04:39.290
<b>I think, we're okay now...</b>

04:40.880 --> 04:41.670
<b>But...</b>

04:46.500 --> 04:48.830
<b>...we've suffered huge losses.</b>

04:50.460 --> 04:51.540
<b>Here it comes.</b>

04:52.920 --> 04:54.250
<b>Get out of the room.</b>

04:54.250 --> 04:56.330
<b>Huh? Whoa, hey...!</b>

04:59.420 --> 05:00.960
<b>What's up, Yayoi-chan?</b>

05:01.670 --> 05:03.420
<b>What's coming?</b>

05:04.420 --> 05:05.500
<b>The devouring.</b>

05:07.130 --> 05:12.330
<b>That god damaged everyone
and upset the power balance in my room.</b>

05:13.250 --> 05:15.920
<b>The weak spirits will be devoured by the strong...</b>

05:16.380 --> 05:19.420
<b>...so the strong can live on.</b>

05:22.330 --> 05:24.710
<b>They'll keep going until there's only one left.</b>

05:36.750 --> 05:41.750
<b>Yayoi</b>

05:41.750 --> 05:46.250
<b>Yayoi</b>

05:46.630 --> 05:48.380
<b>Are they all dead?</b>

05:48.380 --> 05:49.250
<b>No.</b>

05:49.580 --> 05:50.330
<b>Huh?</b>

05:50.500 --> 05:52.500
<b>Yayoi</b>

05:53.580 --> 05:56.830
<b>A new Graduate has been born.</b>

06:02.330 --> 06:06.290
<b>Yayoi-chan, what do you mean by "Graduate"?</b>

06:06.540 --> 06:07.580
<b>Well-</b>

06:09.920 --> 06:12.290
<b>What the...? Who's calling me this late?</b>

06:13.290 --> 06:15.790
<b>Yayoi-chan</b>

06:14.580 --> 06:15.790
<b>Yayoi-chan?</b>

06:16.290 --> 06:17.290
<b>Don't pick up.</b>

06:18.130 --> 06:19.880
<b>It'll end you.</b>

06:20.630 --> 06:24.460
<b>If she hadn't told me, I would've picked it up right away...
The hell is going on?</b>

06:25.580 --> 06:29.130
<b>Yayoi-chan, why're you calling me?</b>

06:29.500 --> 06:30.290
<b>Eiko!</b>

06:31.210 --> 06:32.960
<b>Yayoi</b>

06:36.580 --> 06:38.750
<b>Yayoi-chan</b>

06:39.330 --> 06:40.460
<b>It won't open!</b>

06:40.920 --> 06:44.170
<b>Crap, she doesn't know what's going on!
If she picks up now...</b>

06:44.750 --> 06:47.960
<b>Don't pick up the phone, Eiko! That's not Yayoi-chan!</b>

06:48.580 --> 06:49.670
<b>Eiko!</b>

06:50.290 --> 06:52.290
<b>Yayoi-chan</b>

06:52.920 --> 06:54.380
<b>Should I pick up?</b>

07:00.000 --> 07:02.630
<b>Kei-kun, what's wrong?! Can you hear me?!</b>

07:02.630 --> 07:03.540
<b>Eiko!</b>

07:03.540 --> 07:04.460
<b>C'mon.</b>

07:05.000 --> 07:07.250
<b>Pick up the phone.</b>

07:08.790 --> 07:10.040
<b>Please...</b>

07:10.330 --> 07:11.460
<b>pick up...</b>

07:12.170 --> 07:13.210
<b>the phone.</b>

07:13.630 --> 07:15.750
<b>That's not Eiko!</b>

07:20.920 --> 07:24.880
<b>Kei-kun? Yayoi-chan? Ai-chan?</b>

07:32.750 --> 07:34.250
<b>F-footsteps?!</b>

07:43.210 --> 07:46.540
<b>Pick up the goddamn phone!</b>

07:55.130 --> 07:56.080
<b>Eiko!</b>

07:59.210 --> 08:00.250
<b>Kei-kun!</b>

08:03.420 --> 08:04.630
<b>Thank God...</b>

08:05.750 --> 08:07.460
<b>Get it now, Keitaro?</b>

08:09.000 --> 08:13.920
<b>These spirits are so powerful
that I can't contain their influence just to my room.</b>

08:14.960 --> 08:19.420
<b>They could cause trouble
up to five houses away from mine.</b>

08:20.500 --> 08:24.540
<b>That's why I keep them locked up far away from here.</b>

08:24.880 --> 08:28.710
<b>They've "graduated" from my room.</b>

08:29.920 --> 08:34.960
<b>This'll hold it for now.
Let's call it a night and talk in the morning.</b>

08:38.420 --> 08:39.630
<b>In the end,</b>

08:41.290 --> 08:45.170
<b>our confrontation with none other than a divine being</b>

08:46.380 --> 08:50.080
<b>led to the loss of many of Yayoi-chan's dolls,</b>

08:50.710 --> 08:53.460
<b>but also the creation of an evolved spirit:</b>

08:54.380 --> 09:00.460
<b>a monster on a completely different level of power
we would come to call a "Graduate."</b>

09:01.460 --> 09:09.330
<b>The trade-off for that Graduate
would end up leading us down a new path...</b>

09:12.960 --> 09:14.170
<b>The next day,</b>

09:14.630 --> 09:21.170
<b>we would return to Ai-chan's apartment to finish up,
then clean up Yayoi-chan's room.</b>

09:22.540 --> 09:25.670
<b>This is how we're going to guide the spirits
in and out of the room?</b>

09:26.210 --> 09:30.330
<b>Yes. First, we'll keep them
from coming into her bedroom.</b>

09:31.000 --> 09:31.710
<b>Here.</b>

09:33.580 --> 09:34.710
<b>What's this for?</b>

09:35.540 --> 09:37.960
<b>Put these where we want the spirits to go.</b>

09:37.960 --> 09:41.000
<b>It'll create a path for them.</b>

09:48.960 --> 09:56.880
<b>Now the spirits you attract will come through
those signs, stop here, and leave.</b>

09:57.290 --> 09:59.830
<b>Why will they leave after coming here?</b>

10:00.080 --> 10:02.290
<b>Wait, is it 'cause it's gross in here?</b>

10:03.000 --> 10:04.880
<b>Make sure you clean in here!</b>

10:04.880 --> 10:07.710
<b>Ooh, I could buy a vacuum robot!</b>

10:07.710 --> 10:09.540
<b>Omigosh, our lives would be so much easier!</b>

10:08.130 --> 10:11.630
<b>Probably for the best she doesn't know...</b>

10:09.540 --> 10:10.630
<b>You're so right! That's such a good idea!</b>

10:10.630 --> 10:11.630
<b>Can you imagine?</b>

10:11.960 --> 10:13.420
<b>Time to clean my room.</b>

10:18.880 --> 10:20.040
<b>Oh wow...</b>

10:20.040 --> 10:23.460
<b>It kinda, like, looks worse than last night.</b>

10:29.830 --> 10:31.000
<b>Oh, wow...</b>

10:31.290 --> 10:32.380
<b>Hey...</b>

10:34.040 --> 10:37.460
<b>I don't know what happened after I passed out.</b>

10:38.460 --> 10:41.460
<b>I didn't mess stuff up for you again, did I?</b>

10:41.460 --> 10:43.750
<b>No, we just carried you to the couch.</b>

10:44.330 --> 10:47.170
<b>Yep! Glad you didn't hurt yourself.</b>

10:48.080 --> 10:50.080
<b>Okay. That's good to know.</b>

10:50.920 --> 10:52.330
<b>Huh?! Oh, crap!</b>

10:53.710 --> 10:55.330
<b>What's up, Ai-chan?</b>

10:55.830 --> 10:56.880
<b>Sorry!</b>

10:57.630 --> 11:00.710
<b>I gotta go to my brother's memorial service!</b>

11:01.460 --> 11:04.460
<b>Nakano Station</b>

11:03.580 --> 11:09.040
<b>With that, Ai-chan hurried back
to her hometown of Kyoto.</b>

11:16.960 --> 11:20.580
<b>And once we'd finished cleaning everything up...</b>

11:25.670 --> 11:27.080
<b>Here, drink up.</b>

11:27.880 --> 11:29.460
<b>Thanks...</b>

11:30.040 --> 11:31.790
<b>Thank you...</b>

11:32.250 --> 11:34.130
<b>We're so screwed.</b>

11:34.380 --> 11:40.330
<b>We're not just fighting spirits anymore.
We picked a fight with a freaking GOD...</b>

11:40.630 --> 11:45.420
<b>I forgot I'm not fighting on my own anymore.
Went a little overboard.</b>

11:46.130 --> 11:47.630
<b>Probably should've held back.</b>

11:47.630 --> 11:50.250
<b>Whoa, this is new!</b>

11:50.420 --> 11:55.630
<b>The only reason we're alive is 'cause that god
is the type who likes to fight like this.</b>

11:56.750 --> 12:04.210
<b>I didn't have anything that could deal with a god.
We could've ended up dead.</b>

12:06.380 --> 12:13.080
<b>But there's no turning back now.
We need to dig in our heels and get ready to fight.</b>

12:13.210 --> 12:14.000
<b>Right!</b>

12:15.170 --> 12:21.540
<b>So, as you already know, we're going to travel
to haunted places to capture evil spirits.</b>

12:22.670 --> 12:29.040
<b>Those spirits will help us take down the baddie
that took Mom, the Spectre of Death.</b>

12:29.920 --> 12:34.170
<b>Go to haunted places</b>

12:29.920 --> 12:34.170
<b>and catch evil spirits</b>

12:29.920 --> 12:34.170
<b>Create army of spirits</b>

12:29.920 --> 12:34.170
<b>Defeat Spectre</b>

12:30.420 --> 12:33.000
<b>This was our original plan.</b>

12:35.210 --> 12:42.000
<b>The spirits we capture get put
into dolls with a part of ourselves,</b>

12:42.960 --> 12:46.460
<b>ATTACK</b>

12:43.000 --> 12:46.080
<b>which then protect us from any attacks
brought upon us by other spirits.</b>

12:44.710 --> 12:46.460
<b>HITS DOLL INSTEAD</b>

12:46.460 --> 12:48.670
<b>OUCHIE</b>

12:47.460 --> 12:48.670
<b>OKEY DOKIE</b>

12:48.790 --> 12:51.130
<b>We had about a hundred of them.</b>

12:51.830 --> 12:55.710
<b>They formed a nigh-inpenetrable defense,</b>

12:56.040 --> 13:01.170
<b>and their competition and consumption of other spirits
trained their offensive power.</b>

13:01.170 --> 13:04.580
<b>Wait, you brought them here? To our house?</b>

13:05.000 --> 13:11.420
<b>Don't worry. I've got substitutes protecting all three of us.</b>

13:11.710 --> 13:13.000
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

13:13.080 --> 13:14.170
<b>That's your reaction?!</b>

13:15.380 --> 13:16.540
<b>Last night, however...</b>

13:17.210 --> 13:20.960
<b>Our tussle with that god broke the system.</b>

13:21.500 --> 13:23.750
<b>Now we have more things on our list.</b>

13:23.830 --> 13:27.330
<b>Go to haunted places</b>

13:23.830 --> 13:27.330
<b>and catch evil spirits</b>

13:23.840 --> 13:27.330
<b>(lost a bunch)</b>

13:23.840 --> 13:27.330
<b>Create army of spirits</b>

13:23.840 --> 13:27.330
<b>(and catch the god)</b>

13:23.840 --> 13:27.330
<b>Defeat Spectre</b>

13:24.500 --> 13:25.790
<b>Here's what we have now.</b>

13:27.460 --> 13:33.630
<b>We need to catch ghosts to fix the broken system
and get the strength to catch that god.</b>

13:34.040 --> 13:38.670
<b>And that god will help us take down
the Spectre of Death.</b>

13:38.670 --> 13:43.670
<b>Go to haunted places</b>

13:38.670 --> 13:43.670
<b>and catch evil spirits</b>

13:38.670 --> 13:43.670
<b>(lost a bunch)</b>

13:38.670 --> 13:43.670
<b>Create army of spirits</b>

13:38.670 --> 13:43.670
<b>(and catch the god)</b>

13:38.670 --> 13:43.670
<b>Defeat Spectre</b>

13:39.170 --> 13:43.670
<b>It will also save Ai from her fate as this god's betrothed.</b>

13:44.710 --> 13:48.130
<b>So Step One I get. Step Two, though...</b>

13:46.170 --> 13:48.170
<b>Create army of spirits</b>

13:46.170 --> 13:48.170
<b>(and catch the god)</b>

13:48.500 --> 13:49.540
<b>Is tough.</b>

13:52.130 --> 13:57.080
<b>I know what we have to do,
but how many spirits do we need to catch?</b>

13:58.170 --> 14:02.790
<b>Do we just need to keep doing what we've been doing?</b>

14:03.080 --> 14:05.880
<b>I've killed a god before.</b>

14:06.040 --> 14:06.920
<b>Huh?!</b>

14:07.420 --> 14:08.710
<b>A different one, of course.</b>

14:09.630 --> 14:11.380
<b>Every god is different,</b>

14:11.790 --> 14:14.790
<b>GOD</b>

14:11.960 --> 14:15.210
<b>but I had to use three Graduates to kill that one.</b>

14:15.540 --> 14:17.880
<b>Capturing it would've been way harder.</b>

14:15.960 --> 14:18.330
<b>Killing</b>

14:15.960 --> 14:18.330
<b>Capturing</b>

14:18.500 --> 14:25.630
<b>GOD</b>

14:18.540 --> 14:20.790
<b>So we'll need even more firepower.</b>

14:21.210 --> 14:25.630
<b>At least six Graduates if we're going to succeed.</b>

14:25.920 --> 14:27.750
<b>Killing</b>

14:25.920 --> 14:27.750
<b>Capturing</b>

14:28.420 --> 14:33.380
<b>We can at least estimate
what we'll need to win. There's hope.</b>

14:34.790 --> 14:36.170
<b>Yayoi-chan...</b>

14:36.960 --> 14:39.130
<b>Here's our real problem, though.</b>

14:40.420 --> 14:43.210
<b>As of right now,</b>

14:44.170 --> 14:46.250
<b>I've got on our roster...</b>

14:48.170 --> 14:49.460
<b>...three Graduates.</b>

14:50.670 --> 14:53.500
<b>Not including the one from yesterday.</b>

14:54.710 --> 14:58.920
<b>There's also the seven Jizo
who were haunting me a month ago.</b>

14:59.710 --> 15:03.710
<b>I had them fight one another
to create a Transcendent Jizo.</b>

15:04.040 --> 15:06.630
<b>He's a little bit stronger than my other Graduates.</b>

15:07.710 --> 15:08.830
<b>That makes five.</b>

15:09.330 --> 15:11.040
<b>We'll take those five with us...</b>

15:11.040 --> 15:15.630
<b>as we take a grand tour of haunted Japan
and capture every spirit in our path.</b>

15:33.130 --> 15:35.920
<b>You want to go on a tour of Japan...?</b>

15:35.920 --> 15:40.630
<b>Yes. We'll continue to seek out our typical haunts,</b>

15:40.920 --> 15:43.830
<b>but I'd like to capture
at least one more Graduate-level spirit.</b>

