18:06.580 --> 18:10.330
<b>Y'know, she's never asked me
to hang out like this before...</b>

18:10.790 --> 18:12.750
<b>I hope everything's okay.</b>

18:15.880 --> 18:19.290
<b>We've gotten ourselves into quite the mess, huh?</b>

18:19.500 --> 18:20.380
<b>Yeah.</b>

18:20.960 --> 18:24.750
<b>Can't believe you went
and picked a fight with an actual god.</b>

18:24.920 --> 18:27.670
<b>Don't think we've got enough lives
to survive this boss fight.</b>

18:27.920 --> 18:29.460
<b>You did it, too.</b>

18:31.420 --> 18:33.710
<b>I surprised myself there.</b>

18:34.170 --> 18:39.420
<b>I was so freaking scared,
but I couldn't just sit there and say nothing.</b>

18:39.540 --> 18:40.420
<b>Mm-hmm.</b>

18:42.580 --> 18:43.460
<b>I...</b>

18:45.250 --> 18:49.710
<b>I've been fighting by myself this whole time,
all to get my Mom back.</b>

18:51.880 --> 18:55.670
<b>But when you stood there to protect me...</b>

18:56.380 --> 18:59.790
<b>It showed me you were willing to fight with me.</b>

19:01.460 --> 19:02.710
<b>And that made me happy.</b>

19:04.130 --> 19:08.460
<b>So happy... that I picked a pretty big fight.</b>

19:10.830 --> 19:12.920
<b>You're my problem student, huh?</b>

19:16.170 --> 19:19.580
<b>There's something I've been meaning to tell you.</b>

19:19.830 --> 19:20.580
<b>Huh?</b>

19:22.130 --> 19:23.420
<b>Since I'm riding behind him,</b>

19:24.290 --> 19:26.420
<b>and I can't see his face...</b>

19:26.540 --> 19:27.750
<b>I can say it out loud.</b>

19:29.130 --> 19:32.790
<b>Before, I said you were great to use as bait.</b>

19:34.960 --> 19:37.830
<b>But you're more than that now.</b>

19:41.000 --> 19:43.040
<b>You're a great partner.</b>

19:45.500 --> 19:46.540
<b>Thanks.</b>

19:49.580 --> 19:53.460
<b>She asked me to hang out just to tell me that...</b>

19:56.790 --> 20:01.830
<b>Anywhere you want to go, Yayoi-chan?
I owe you one. It'll be my treat.</b>

20:06.130 --> 20:06.830
<b>Sure.</b>

